Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: xfce4-terminal, thunar, chromium | firefox-esr
Suggests: xdock, icewm
Description: compact AI Workspace application launcher
 XLaunch provides a small X11 desktop menu and a full-screen application
 launcher. On Linux it discovers freedesktop .desktop entries, uses the
 active icon theme, and starts applications through gio.
